    "title": "Man stabbed in Worcester; Suspect in custody - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Susannah Sudborough ,\n3 hours ago Worcester police arrested a suspect after a man was stabbed Wednesday afternoon, according to the police department. The man was stabbed on Wildwood Avenue, a Worcester police spokesperson said in an email. The victim was alive when he was taken to a hospital. It is unclear what condition the man who was stabbed is in as of Wednesday night. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
